Hohner 595BL Blue Midnight Harmonica Key of C (20) $55.99$36.99 Add to Cart Silver Creek Iron Works Harmonica Key of C C (21) $7.99 Add to Cart Hohner Case of Special 20s Harmonica 5-Pack (28) $238.55 Add to Cart Hohner Blues Band Harmonica Value Pack (7) $26.99 Add to Cart Silver Creek Diamondback Harmonica E (9) $32.99 Add to Cart \"\"Fender Blues Deluxe Harmonica Set (7-Pack with Case, Keys of C, G, A, D, F, E and Bb)\"\" (6) $71.63 Add to Cart \"\"Hohner Special 20 Harmonica 5-Pack - Keys G,A,C,D,E\"\" $199.83 Add to Cart \"\"Hohner Hoodoo Blues Harmonica 3-Pack with Case C,D,G\"\" (24) $35.88$26.49 Add to Cart Fender Blues Deville Harmonica Bb (13) $42.99 Add to Cart Hohner Marine Band Crossover Harmonica G $93.49 Add to Cart 1611 ❯ Description The Hohner Special 20 Harmonica stands out because it's easy to play and built to last. The comb—the part in the middle that you blow through—is made from strong, airtight plastic. This makes the harp less likely to swell or break, even if you play it a lot. Each note sounds clear and full, and the reeds respond fast, so you can bend notes more easily. Bending lets you change the pitch, which makes solos and blues riffs sound cool. Famous musicians like John Popper use this harmonica on big stages and in recording studios. The Special 20 comes with a sturdy case and access to 30 days of free online lessons to help you get started. Easy Note Bending and Rich Sound From Hohner Musicians looking for a harp that makes bending simple will notice the difference right away. The plastic comb doesn't absorb moisture, so every note stays crisp even during long jams. Beginners can use the included lessons to learn classic songs. More experienced players will like how the reeds respond to soft and loud playing. Taking this harmonica on the road is easy thanks to the tough case. With these features, you can focus on learning new songs and having fun as your playing gets better. Features Durable plastic comb keeps airflow tight for easy playing and bending Superior bending helps create cool effects like bluesy wails and dips Case protects the harmonica from scratches when stored or carried Free online lessons teach new techniques to help improve your playing More Items to Consider ❮ Proline GS1E Classic Guitar Stand for Acoustic & Electric Guitars (26) $14.99 Add to Cart Fender Blues Deluxe Harmonica C (23) $13.99 Add to Cart Hohner Special 20 Harmonica D (4) $58.80 Add to Cart Lee Oskar Major Diatonic Harmonica C (69) $56.99$49.99 Add to Cart Fender Blues Deville Harmonica A (13) $42.99 Add to Cart Hohner 270 Super Chromonica Chromatic Harmonica G (8) $215.00 Add to Cart Silver Creek Black Gold Harmonica G (28) $19.99 Add to Cart Hohner Marine Band Harmonica F# (2) $58.99 Add to Cart \"\"Fender Blues Deluxe Harmonicas (3-Pack with Case, Keys of C, G and A)\"\" (1) $39.99 Add to Cart Lee Oskar 1910MJ2-C Mick Jagger Signature Series Harmonica Edition 2 (1) $59.00$49.99 Add to Cart Hohner M2009BX-A Marine Band Crossover Harmonica G (41) $93.05 Add to Cart Hohner Blues Band 7-Piece Harmonica Set 1501 (38) $66.49 Add to Cart Hohner PentaHarp Harmonica Low F minor (14) $53.49 Add to Cart Hohner Blues Harp Harmonica "}
